<body>
    <h1>Value Set Packages</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><span>A Value Set Package contains a=
ll the expanded value sets required for an implementation guide. US Core pu=
blishes annual value set packages that contain value sets expanded with upd=
ated code system versions for each release year. These packages are availab=
le for several US Core Versions to help implementers. To download, click th=
e appropriate link below for your desired US Core Version and file format (=
JSON, XML, or CSV). Each link provides a zip file containing the selected V=
alue Set Package.</span></p>
